        "cooked": "<p>Hi everybody,</p><p>My girlfriend and I got stuck on the name of the card \"Cedistic Dissonant\" and we're having trouble figuring out what it means. I've done my usual due diligence pile of searches and I just can't find the word anywhere. &nbsp;Is it a typo, perhaps? &nbsp;I don't mean to be calling anyone out for anything, I just really hate not knowing what a word means. :)</p>",
